:: Domus Window Door
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "domus">><<effects>>
You walk around the house and find a back door.
<br><br>
You try the handle. It's locked, but the old latch breaks when you lean against the door. You step inside.
<br><br>
<<link [[Look around|Domus Window]]>><<set $domusWindowDoorEntry to true>><</link>>
<br>

